# Prettier pads every cell in a markdown table to the width of that table's
# widest cell. The capability register has 399 rows and cells up to 918
# characters, so appending ONE row with long evidence text rewrites every other
# row in the section.
#
# Measured on PR #235: 208 added lines in the register, of which 166 were pure
# whitespace reflow and only 42 were real content. Two agents appending to
# different sections of the same file therefore conflict on nearly every line —
# and the register is the one file AGENTS.md requires both of them to touch.
#
# Nothing runs `prettier --check` in CI, and scripts/register-baseline.mjs trims
# every captured cell, so the register's formatting is load-bearing for nobody.
docs/enterprise-readiness/capability-register.md
